DE AUGOSTOS INVESTMENTS - Maintenance Schedule Guide
====================================================

Recommended Service Intervals for German Vehicles:

Every 5,000 km / 3 months:
- Oil and filter change
- Fluid level check
- Tyre pressure check

Every 10,000 km / 6 months:
- All of the above plus:
- Air filter inspection
- Brake inspection
- Battery test

Every 20,000 km / 12 months:
- All of the above plus:
- Spark plug replacement
- Cabin filter replacement
- Full diagnostic scan
- Brake fluid replacement

Every 40,000 km / 2 years:
- All of the above plus:
- Transmission fluid service
- Coolant replacement
- Fuel filter replacement
- Timing belt inspection

Every 60,000 km / 3 years:
- Major service including:
- All of the above
- Complete fluid replacement
- Full suspension inspection
- A/C service

Note: Always refer to your vehicle's owner manual
for manufacturer-specific recommendations.
